      "requirement": "Gray June21 body reports pollen on stigma beforeopening, but his parenthetical never noticed bees about a Fumariaceæ is not restricted to unopenedflowers; it is personal observation, not universal absence. Darwin August16 marginal observation of B.hortense andAdlumia remains separate datedresearch provenance, excluded fromRAFTprose. It can inform knowledge chronology but doesnotproveexactreceipt;1858year followscontext, notexplicitannotationyear.",
